MERGE (n:Incident:RiskModelNode {uid: 'incident:2025-05-28_cork_v1'})
SET n += {affected_assets: [], affected_protocols: [], amount_lost_usd: 12000000, chains: [], confidence: 'high', date: '2025-05-28', event_type: 'exploit', incident_id: 'incident:2025-05-28_cork_v1', near_miss: false, notes: 'Code bug — access control flaw: CorkHook.beforeSwap() had no caller restriction, allowing anyone to pass arbitrary CorkCall hook data. Combined with missing market parameter validation (CorkConfig allowed setting DS as redemption asset), attacker created a fake market, double-counted derivative tokens, and redeemed 3,761 wstETH (~$12M). OUT OF SCOPE — smart contract ACL/logic bug. Sources: https://www.cork.tech/blog/post-mortem https://www.halborn.com/blog/post/explained-the-cork-protocol-hack-may-2025 https://www.certik.com/resources/blog/cork-protocol-incident-analysis', risk_ids: '[]', source_path: 'incidents/auto_2025-05-28_cork_v1.yaml', source_urls: '["https://x.com/CyversAlerts/status/1927701403092316254"]', title: 'Cork V1', uid: 'incident:2025-05-28_cork_v1'};

MERGE (n:Incident:RiskModelNode {uid: 'incident:2025-06-06_alex'})
SET n += {affected_assets: [], affected_protocols: [], amount_lost_usd: 8369999, chains: [], confidence: 'high', date: '2025-06-06', event_type: 'exploit', incident_id: 'incident:2025-06-06_alex', near_miss: false, notes: 'Code bug — self-listing verification logic flaw on Stacks blockchain. Attacker deployed a malicious token (ssl-labubu-672d3) with a deceptive transfer function, exploited set-approved-token to gain vault-level access, then drained pools of STX, sBTC, USDC/USDT, WBTC (~$8.4M). OUT OF SCOPE — smart contract access control / logic bug. Sources: https://www.halborn.com/blog/post/explained-the-alex-protocol-hack-june-2025 https://rekt.news/alexlab-rekt2 https://x.com/ALEXLabBTC/status/1931014419133169734', risk_ids: '[]', source_path: 'incidents/auto_2025-06-06_alex.yaml', source_urls: '["https://x.com/ALEXLabBTC/status/1931014419133169734"]', title: 'ALEX', uid: 'incident:2025-06-06_alex'};

